## Interface: 16001
## Title: PvP Tally
## Notes: Keeps a tally of every world PvP kill and death, one row per enemy player.
## Notes-esES: Registra cada kill y cada muerte en PvP de mundo, una fila por jugador enemigo.
## Notes-esMX: Registra cada kill y cada muerte en PvP de mundo, una fila por jugador enemigo.
## Version: 1.1.0
## Category: Combat
## Category-esES: Combate
## Category-esMX: Combate
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Bone_HumanSkull_01
## SavedVariables: PvPTallyDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: PvPTallyCharDB
## AddonCompartmentFunc: PvPTally_OnAddonCompartmentClick

# Self-contained: no dependencies on other addons. Spy's saved data is only read, when
# it happens to be loaded, to offer a one-time import.

Locales.lua

# Core: pure logic, no game API calls.
Core\Util.lua
Core\Events.lua
Core\Settings.lua
Core\Store.lua
Core\Races.lua

# Game: the only layer that reads the WoW API, and the kill / death detection.
Game\WowApi.lua
Game\Tracker.lua

# Features built on the core.
Features\SpyImport.lua
Features\TestData.lua
Features\Notifications.lua

# User interface.
UI\Columns.lua
UI\ListModel.lua
UI\Rows.lua
UI\Window.lua
UI\MinimapButton.lua
UI\SettingsPanel.lua

Commands.lua
Init.lua
